---
import Legal from '@/layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';

const sections = [
  { id: 'who', title: 'Who we are' },
  { id: 'collect', title: 'What we collect' },
  { id: 'use', title: 'How we use it' },
  { id: 'share', title: 'Who we share it with' },
  { id: 'cookies', title: 'Cookies & tracking' },
  { id: 'keep', title: 'How long we keep it' },
  { id: 'rights', title: 'Your rights' },
  { id: 'security', title: 'Security' },
  { id: 'changes', title: 'Changes & contact' },
];
---

<Legal
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How Zemprolabs collects, uses and protects the information you share through zemprolabs.com."
  image="/og/privacy.jpg"
  updated="13 November 2026"
  sections={sections}
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what information we collect when you use zemprolabs.com, why we collect it and what you can
    ask us to do with it. We’ve kept it short and in plain language.
  </p>

  <h2 id="who">Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    Zemprolabs is a digital studio at {site.address.street}, {site.address.locality}, {site.address.city},
    {site.address.region}, {site.address.country}. For anything in this policy, email
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="collect">What we collect</h2>
  <p>We only collect what you choose to send us:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Project enquiries:</strong> your name, email, company, phone or WhatsApp number, country, the services you’re interested in and your message.</li>
    <li><strong>Job applications:</strong> your name, email, phone, city, experience, the area you’re applying for and the link to your CV or portfolio.</li>
    <li><strong>Direct contact:</strong> anything you send us by email, phone or WhatsApp.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Like most websites, our hosting provider automatically records basic technical information (such as IP address,
    browser type and the pages requested) to keep the site running and secure.
  </p>

  <h2 id="use">How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your enquiry and discuss your project.</li>
    <li>To prepare proposals and, if we work together, to deliver the work.</li>
    <li>To assess job applications and contact candidates.</li>
    <li>To keep the website secure and working properly.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We don’t sell your information, and we don’t add you to marketing lists without asking.</p>

  <h2 id="share">Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>We use a small number of trusted services to run the site:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Web3Forms</strong>, which delivers form submissions to our inbox.</li>
    <li><strong>Vercel</strong>, which hosts the website.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong>, which serves the typefaces used on the site.</li>
    <li><strong>Vercel Web Analytics</strong>, which counts page visits anonymously so we know which pages are useful.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    These providers process data only to provide their service. We may also disclose information if the law requires
    it.
  </p>

  <h2 id="cookies">Cookies &amp; tracking</h2>
  <p>
    We don’t use advertising cookies or cross-site tracking. We use Vercel Web Analytics to count page visits; it
    doesn’t set cookies and doesn’t identify you personally, and it only records things like the page viewed, the
    referring site, your country and your device type.
  </p>
  <p>
    The site also stores one temporary value in your browser’s session storage to run the page-transition animation; it
    is deleted when you close the tab and contains no personal information.
  </p>

  <h2 id="keep">How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep enquiries for as long as we’re discussing or working on a project with you, and for up to 24 months after
    our last contact if no project goes ahead. We keep job applications for up to 12 months so we can contact you about
    future roles, unless you ask us to delete them sooner.
  </p>

  <h2 id="rights">Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us to show you the information we hold about you, correct it, or delete it. Depending on where you
    live, laws such as India’s Digital Personal Data Protection Act, the UK GDPR or US state privacy laws may give you
    additional rights. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we’ll respond within 30 days.
  </p>

  <h2 id="security">Security</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served over HTTPS and we limit access to enquiries to the people who need it. No system is perfectly
    secure, but we take reasonable steps to protect what you share with us.
  </p>

  <h2 id="changes">Changes &amp; contact</h2>
  <p>
    If we change this policy we’ll update the date at the top of this page. Questions or requests:
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
